{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50233","headline":"及第後读书院咏物[一]十首上礼部李侍郎 □□（伯三四八○） · 樊铸","name":"及第後读书院咏物[一]十首上礼部李侍郎 □□（伯三四八○）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铸剑本来杀雠[一]人，怀珠本来报国士。\n信知善恶皆相报，如何不肯树桃李。\n物情飜覆难可论，莫言权势长头[二]存。\n鼎食却爲农桑子，布衣还启丞相门。\n丈夫立身须自省，知祸知福如形影。\n乍可惠人一饭恩，不得唾人千里井。\n（[一]原作「雠杀」，依刘校互乙。\n[二]刘云：「『长头』二字乃俗语。\n『头』，尾声。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"樊铸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50233.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50233","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}